# Crystal Barricade: "Prevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to other creatures you control" (CR 615.1). Bot1
# controls Crystal Barricade (0/4) and Cathar Commando (3/1). Bot2, with Black Lotus and a Mountain, casts four Lightning
# Bolts: the first at Cathar Commando is prevented by Crystal Barricade (Commando lives, no damage); two at Crystal
# Barricade itself deal 3 each - it is not one of the "other" creatures - and kill it (6 damage, CR 704.5g); the fourth at
# Cathar Commando, with Crystal Barricade gone, is no longer prevented and kills it. Only the first Bolt is prevented.

